                                                "sense_id": "ee8895e7-e948-3112-bfe6-bdc3c983104d",
                                                "text": "Moscow has been targeted with a large-scale drone attack for the first time in its 15-month-old war in Ukraine, marking a new inflection point in the conflict, with the Kremlin threatening to take the “harshest possible measures” in response to the strikes."
