                                                "sense_id": "ee8895e7-e948-3112-bfe6-bdc3c983104d",
                                                "text": "These companies are at an inflection point. With Mr. Trump’s election, Silicon Valley’s power will reach new heights."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b30349c-b049-44c5-8da6-55e27d9f74b2",
                                                "sense_id": "ee8895e7-e948-3112-bfe6-bdc3c983104d",
                                                "text": "He's hazy on the ideas or moments that definitely shifted his political worldview, but he says: “I've always been good at spotting inflection points and trends.”"
